# REPLACE THIS FILE WITH YOUR OWN MASTER RESUME

This is a placeholder master resume. The auto-ATS app uses `master.txt` as the
source-of-truth for baseline ATS scoring and resume tailoring.

## How to add your resume

1. Paste your full resume text into this file and save it as `master.txt`, OR
2. Use the app: click the gear icon on any job → choose RESUME → Upload/Paste.

## What should go here

Everything: summary, skills, experience, projects, education, certifications.
The more detail you include, the better the ATS scorer and the AI tailoring.

---

Example format (delete this and replace with your real resume):

YOUR NAME
Location: Your City, ST
Contact: email@example.com • linkedin.com/in/yourprofile

PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY
A results-driven [role] with X years of experience in [skills]. Proven track record of...

CORE SKILLS
- Python, Django, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Git, CI/CD
- React, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, CSS
- Leadership, project management, cross-functional collaboration

EXPERIENCE
Company Name — Role | Start – End
- Accomplishment with metric
- Another accomplishment

PROJECTS
Project Name — description and technologies used.

EDUCATION
Degree — School — Year

CERTIFICATIONS
- Certification Name — Year
